<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-23T01:42:28.178Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:42:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis attacked Saudi Dammam airport, killing two people and claiming further strikes on Saudi targets. In response, the U.S. ordered some diplomats to leave Saudi Arabia and Saudi Aramco evacuated staff from Dhahran, moving them to remote work. Iran reported that seven oil tankers were attacked in the Strait of Hormuz, linking the maritime threat to the regional escalation. Protests erupted in Turkey against Saudi involvement while Egypt called for Yemen talks as its parliament debated military support to Saudi Arabia. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQOGZ2VEpSaUZoaWQwZHVVek1fYUJpT25DU2RIaU5mWWFVTkJZa3p1bTRXZHE1SlRTb2pMS3pOZEVKQU10MkpSeHNfY0h1Ul9PdGYxdFNvTzBWQWVidnJfTTJYUC12NjM3S01namtXWmVjcll5elY5ODVIVXlKejNKbWZ1d2xPS0YxOG9EcUdFb0hxYlBhWHBRSkJkWkhTU2pqT3ZPdFNyT3dYMTBsRm83d2Rn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOM1lHOVNpNGlkdFJyR1gyVzRuQVRHQnE5MmdzRWJIOXZEaFVuOGl4ampsbVpyRkpYbUhOWjV1NGpTQ19PeEhwQ3lWcVRUR0R5dk9pMlA3dVFNZ3VZWEYwWlpTVkg0cEFsbDJLVDVhWVdiWk1kaHo3eDhOY0l4SXVuQnpFOW5NVmZCTXZlTFlGSElldWZiZkw4VHViN3Zra0tnbHhUaEJ1Q3JtMEtqcFl1SktzdWNqVWp2a3lR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sight Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kmvt.com/2026/10/22/iran-says-7-oil-tankers-were-attacked-strait-hormuz-fears-grow-return-war/&quot;&gt;kmvt.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.cambodiantimes.com/news/279393358/saudi-dammam-airport-attack-kills-2-as-houthis-claim-further-strikes&quot;&gt;cambodiantimes.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE8yVzBTM3hhbzFVQ0x4UzlkS2R1ZGpOOHFQd2ZRc2o3YVpNc0JuMHlpRk52VmlRdnRSOEJjWXhOTGJGYnJVb2RPUDhfckYtYVV5TExlQmlxUUYybllmcHVpczQ2bjlxb1VGZjBKSngzSVhKVmVtN3pO